---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";
import Breadcrumbs from "../components/Breadcrumbs.astro";
import { site } from "../lib/site";
---

<Layout
  title={`Hard Water Damage Explained — ${site.city}`}
  description={`What ${site.gpgLabel} water (${site.gpgLow}-${site.gpgHigh} GPG) does to pipes, appliances, and skin in ${site.city}, ${site.stateAbbr}.`}
>
  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: "Hard Water Explained" }]} />
      <p class="eyebrow">{site.gpgLow}–{site.gpgHigh} GPG in {site.city}</p>
      <h1>Hard Water Effects in {site.city}</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="brand-backlink">
        <a href="/" class="brand-link">{site.city} Water Softeners</a>
        {" "}provides hard water treatment and scale prevention across {site.city} and {site.county}.
      </p>

      <div class="section-header">
        <p>At {site.gpgLabel} levels, {site.city} tap water carries enough dissolved calcium and magnesium to leave visible and invisible damage throughout your home over time.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-3">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Appliance Damage</h3>
          <p>Scale buildup inside water heaters, dishwashers, and washing machines reduces efficiency and can cut appliance lifespan by years, according to manufacturer maintenance data for {site.gpgLabel.toLowerCase()} water areas like {site.city}.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Pipe Scale</h3>
          <p>Mineral deposits narrow pipe diameter over time, reducing water pressure and increasing the risk of clogs in older {site.city} homes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Skin & Hair Effects</h3>
          <p>Hard water can leave skin feeling dry and hair looking dull, since mineral residue interferes with soap and shampoo rinsing cleanly.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="background: var(--color-surface);">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Visible Signs of Hard Water in {site.city}</h2>
        <p>{site.city} homeowners typically notice five signs first, according to {site.waterAuthority}'s hardness data:</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="signs-list">
        <li>White, chalky spots on dishes, faucets, and shower glass</li>
        <li>Soap and shampoo with reduced lather</li>
        <li>Stiff, scratchy laundry even after washing</li>
        <li>Reduced water pressure from scale-narrowed pipes</li>
        <li>Rising water heater energy bills</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Get a free water test to confirm which of these signs trace back to hardness in your home.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-dark">
    <div class="container final-cta">
      <h2>Stop the Damage Before It Adds Up</h2>
      <p>A properly sized softener eliminates hardness minerals before they reach your plumbing and appliances. As of {site.city}'s current {site.gpgLow}-{site.gpgHigh} GPG reading, see how a system compares on our <a href="/comparison/">system comparison page</a>.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/quote/">Get a Free Water Softener Quote in {site.city}</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .page-header {
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 42, 85, 0.82) 0%, rgba(15, 35, 64, 0.88) 100%),
        url('/hard-water-header.jpg');
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
    }
    .signs-list { display: grid; gap: 12px; max-width: 640px; padding-left: 20px; }
    .final-cta { text-align: center; }
    .final-cta p { max-width: 48ch; margin: 0 auto 24px; }
  </style>
</Layout>
